# recorded on iPhone 17 Pro with Blackmagic Camera for iOS.
# 
# INPUT   Apple Log 2, Apple Wide Gamut, full range (0.0 = black, 1.0 = clip)
# OUTPUT  Rec.709 primaries, gamma 2.4, SDR, full range
# 
# CHAIN   Apple Log / Apple Log 2 decode (Apple Log Profile White Paper,
#         Sept 2023, constants unchanged in the Apple Log 2 White Paper,
#         Sept 2025) -> Apple Wide Gamut to Rec.709 matrix (D65 to D65,
#         no chromatic adaptation) -> negative-gamut compression ->
#         neutral filmic tone map -> creative look in OkLab -> gamma 2.4.
# 
# APPLE LOG CONSTANTS USED
#         R0=-0.05641088  Rt=0.01  c=47.28711236
